  "subject": "Separate isolated original-client S6 relog continuation from V14 preserved post-S5 snapshot to mission1995 Rogers turn-in",
  "setup": "Copied preserved post-S5 S6 character database into a separate isolated server. Relaunched original client, waited for playable HUD, accepted Training Day, walked ordinary controls to Outpost Commander Rogers. No live Game/DIT change. The relog boundary is explicit and is not the same V14 client session.",
